# Build context for the API image.
#
# The context is the repository root so the image can bundle both the service
# code (skill-service/) and the seed catalog (storage/).  The service copies
# the seed tree into an empty storage root on first boot, so a fresh Railway
# volume still serves a non-empty catalog.
.git
.gitignore
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
skill-library-web
storage/books
storage/tasks.json
storage/zips/.tmp
.env
.env.local
*.pem
node_modules
.next
